/.github        export-ignore
/tests          export-ignore
# docs/ ships in the package: UPGRADING.md tells editions to read docs/design/*.md and docs/rmm/POSTGRES.md before adopting a feature,
# and those files are only useful if they are actually in vendor/rivet/rivet-core, not just in a dev checkout of this repo.
# The UI asset installer/checker and the RMM data store CLI scripts ship in the package (editions run them from vendor/rivet/rivet-core,
# docs/rmm/POSTGRES.md and UPGRADING.md "Adopting the data store setting and migration"); every other script (bench/load harnesses, etc.) stays dev-only.
/scripts/* export-ignore
/scripts/install-ui-assets.php -export-ignore
/scripts/check-ui-assets.php -export-ignore
/scripts/ui-assets-lib.php -export-ignore
/scripts/rmm-postgres.php -export-ignore
/scripts/rmm-postgres-backup.sh -export-ignore
/scripts/rmm-postgres-restore.sh -export-ignore
/scripts/rmm-store-migrate.php -export-ignore
/scripts/rmm-store-verify.php -export-ignore
/endpoint-agent export-ignore
/phpunit.xml.dist export-ignore
/phpstan.neon   export-ignore
/phpstan-baseline-converters.neon export-ignore
/ROADMAP.md     export-ignore
* text=auto eol=lf
